{"detail":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"ko\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Security-Policy\" content=\"default-src 'none'; script-src 'none'; style-src 'unsafe-inline'; font-src 'self'; img-src https://daesan.ai https://*.daesan.ai https://cafe24img.com https://*.cafe24img.com https://www.kccworld.co.kr/assets/images/ho/bm/img_hb_mark.jpg; connect-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'\"><meta name=\"referrer\" content=\"no-referrer\"><style>@font-face{font-family:Pretendard;font-weight:400;src:url(fonts/400) format(\"woff2\");font-display:swap}@font-face{font-family:Pretendard;font-weight:500;src:url(fonts/500) format(\"woff2\");font-display:swap}@font-face{font-family:Pretendard;font-weight:600;src:url(fonts/600) format(\"woff2\");font-display:swap}@font-face{font-family:Pretendard;font-weight:700;src:url(fonts/700) format(\"woff2\");font-display:swap}@font-face{font-family:Pretendard;font-weight:800;src:url(fonts/800) format(\"woff2\");font-display:swap}html,body{margin:0;padding:0}body{display:flow-root;font:12px/1.5 Pretendard,sans-serif;color:#353535}p,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6,ul,ol,li,dl,dt,dd,figure{margin:0;padding:0}table{width:100%;border:0;border-spacing:0;border-collapse:collapse}img{border:0;vertical-align:top;max-width:100%}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}#cafe24-detail{max-width:790px;margin:auto}@media(min-width:701px){#cafe24-detail h3.ds-block-title{font-size:12px;margin:0 0 20px}}@media(max-width:700px){body{font-size:13px;line-height:1.2;color:#1b1b1b}td,th{line-height:18px}#cafe24-detail{width:95.25%}}</style><style></style></head><body><div id=\"cafe24-detail\"><p align=\"center\">이페</p><p align=\"center\">남미에만 분포하는 수종.</p><p align=\"center\">보통 외장재로 쓰이는 특수목으로 구분한다.</p><p align=\"center\">균이나 병충애에 강해 내장재로서의 수명은 반영구적이며 외장재로서도 현존하는 목재 중 최고의 내구성을 자랑한다.</p><p align=\"center\">데크, 무늬목, 정원용으로 주로 쓰인다.</p><p align=\"center\">가장 비싸게 판매되는 수종 중 하나이며 규격에 제약이 있다.</p><p align=\"center\"></p><p align=\"center\"></p><p align=\"center\"><img class=\"js-smart-img\" title=\"141626bf0fda5fcf7201a14f46616a6b_164520.png\" src=\"https://ecimg.cafe24img.com/pg2383b21973322017/daesan3833/web/mig_img/prod/141626bf0fda5fcf7201a14f46616a6b_164520.png\" /><br style=\"clear:both\" /><img class=\"js-smart-img\" title=\"769eacf217ef1a9cac6834b7a8ee768e_164521.png\" src=\"https://ecimg.cafe24img.com/pg2383b21973322017/daesan3833/web/mig_img/prod/769eacf217ef1a9cac6834b7a8ee768e_164521.png\" /><br style=\"clear:both\" /><img class=\"js-smart-img\" title=\"56e6c793d48a8c1a7bd3565ddff7a9d7_164521.png\" src=\"https://ecimg.cafe24img.com/pg2383b21973322017/daesan3833/web/mig_img/prod/56e6c793d48a8c1a7bd3565ddff7a9d7_164521.png\" /><br style=\"clear:both\" /><img class=\"js-smart-img\" title=\"6431517169d234de56b09fd8e4552e4b_164522.png\" src=\"https://ecimg.cafe24img.com/pg2383b21973322017/daesan3833/web/mig_img/prod/6431517169d234de56b09fd8e4552e4b_164522.png\" /><br style=\"clear:both\" /></p></div></body></html>","additional":[],"unconfirmed":false}